      "message": "We are trying to move away from StringNetworkSpecifier as much as possible (see how we now finally have a public TelephonyNetworkSpecifier and how StringNetworkSpecifier has been removed from @SystemApi).\n\nCan we have a TestNetworkSpecifier for test networks ?\n\n(it it\u0027s a lot of work it can be done in another patch or even left as a TODO, but it feels like it\u0027s fairly small)",
